{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_bbfb8a78a0aa4d5286605b6e40ab6f54","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"4:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"3091\">\n    <frame id=\"4:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"4:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"4:5\" name=\"Workout Class — fitness classes and activity tracking\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"4:6\" name=\"Design a fitness class app: get started, find a workout class, open the Warm up category to see its exercises, and review this week’s activity. Canvas 414 × 896, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"227\">\n      <text id=\"4:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 4 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the illustrations, the avatar, the photos and the icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"176\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"532\" width=\"1312\" height=\"905\">\n      <text id=\"4:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"816\">\n        <frame id=\"4:14\" name=\"01_Onboarding\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"276\">\n          <text id=\"4:15\" name=\"01_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"134\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:16\" name=\"Goal: Understand what the app offers and start.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:18\" name=\"• Actions: “Get started” • Copy: “Best workouts for you” · “You will have everything you need to reach your personal fitness goals — for free!” • Media: Illustration_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"80\" />\n          <text id=\"4:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"206\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:20\" name=\"→ Get started → 02_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"232\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:21\" name=\"02_Home\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"396\">\n          <text id=\"4:22\" name=\"02_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"84\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:23\" name=\"Goal: Find a workout class.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:25\" name=\"• Categories: “Categories” · “See all” · Warm up · Yoga · Squats · Lunge, each with its photo (see DATA) • Greeting: “Hello, Adam Smith” · Avatar_Adam_Smith · menu (Icon_Menu) • Main navigation: tab bar Home / Activity / Profile / Settings · current: Home • Recommendation Class: “Recommendation Class” · “See all” · Yoga Class · “With Rachael Wisdom” · Photo_Yoga_Class · favorite (Icon_Heart) • Search: “Search” (Icon_Search) • Title: “Find Your Workout Class” • Today’s activity: “Today’s activity” · 8.00 AM - 1.30 PM · Illustration_Todays_Activity\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"180\" />\n          <text id=\"4:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"306\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:27\" name=\"→ Warm up category → 03_Warm_Up → Activity tab → 04_Activity\" x=\"24\" y=\"332\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:28\" name=\"03_Warm_Up\" x=\"0\" y=\"420\" width=\"644\" height=\"396\">\n          <text id=\"4:29\" name=\"03_Warm_Up\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"118\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:30\" name=\"Goal: Understand the Warm up session and pick an exercise.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:32\" name=\"• Actions: back (Icon_Back) · more (Icon_More) · play video (Icon_Play) • Description: “Warm up properly before exercising to prevent injury and make your workouts more effective.” • Exercises: “Exercises” · Exercise 1 – Exercise 10, each with photo, duration and play (Icon_Play_Small) (see DATA) • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Home • Media: Photo_Seated_Hug (video cover) • Tags: 37.10 mins (Icon_Clock) · Running (Icon_Running) • Title: “Warm up”\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"180\" />\n          <text id=\"4:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"306\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:34\" name=\"→ back → 02_Home → Activity tab → 04_Activity\" x=\"24\" y=\"332\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:35\" name=\"04_Activity\" x=\"668\" y=\"420\" width=\"644\" height=\"376\">\n          <text id=\"4:36\" name=\"04_Activity\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"102\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:37\" name=\"Goal: Review the calories and activities of a day this week.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:39\" name=\"• Actions: back (Icon_Back) · more (Icon_More) • Activities: Running · Swimming · Cycling, each with time range, hours and kilometers (Icon_Running, Icon_Swimming, Icon_Cycling) (see DATA) • Calories: 1680 kcal • Chart: hourly calories, axis 8AM · 10AM · 12PM · 2PM · 4PM · selected: 4PM · 120 cal • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Activity • Title: “Your activities” • Week: “This week” · Sat 26 – Fri 01 · selected: Mon 28\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n          <text id=\"4:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"286\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:41\" name=\"→ back → 02_Home → Home tab → 02_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"312\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:42\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"1485\" width=\"1312\" height=\"161\">\n      <text id=\"4:43\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:44\" name=\"• Bottom tab bar on 02, 03 and 04 with 4 tabs in this order: Home (Icon_Home), Activity (Icon_Activity), Profile (Icon_Profile), Settings (Icon_Settings). Current: Home on 02 and 03, Activity on 04. How 